    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for all errors indicating malformed binary files. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Having a subclass for all malformed binary files allows archive-walking code to skip malformed files without having to understand every possible way that a binary file might be malformed.</para>
<para>Currently inherits from <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_e_c_error" kindref="compound">ECError</ref> for easy interoperability with std::error_code, but this will be removed in the future. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
